      "ang": 251,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "असं धरे ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "85742",
      "sourceShabadId": "8001",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0251_line_0029",
      "lineIndex": 29,
      "gurmukhi": "ਰਿਸੰ ਭਰੇ ॥੪੯੧॥",
      "transliteration": "risa(n) bhare ||491||",
      "translation": "The warriors felt weakness and then regained strength and in rage caught hold of their swords.491.",
      "punjabiViakhya": "ਅਤੇ ਕ੍ਰੋਧ ਨਾਲ ਭਰੇ ਹੋਏ ਸਨ ॥੪੯੧॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 251,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "रिसं भरे ॥४९१॥",
      "sourceLineId": "85743",
      "sourceShabadId": "8001",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0251_line_0030",
      "lineIndex": 30,
      "gurmukhi": "ਛੁਟੇ ਸਰੰ ॥",
      "transliteration": "chhuTe sara(n) ||",
      "translation": "",
      "punjabiViakhya": "(ਸੂਰਮੇ) ਤੀਰ ਚਲਾਉਾਂਦੇ ਹਨ,",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 251,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "छुटे सरं ॥",
      "sourceLineId": "85744",
      "sourceShabadId": "8001",
      "sourceUpdated": "2022-12-24 02:22:37",
      "raag": ""
    },
    {
      "id": "dasam_ang_0251_line_0031",
      "lineIndex": 31,
