      "punjabiViakhya": "ਮੁਕਾਬਲਾ ਕਰਦੇ ਚਲੇ ਜਾ ਰਹੇ ਹਨ ॥੪੯੪॥",
      "source": "DASAM_GRANTH",
      "ang": 251,
      "hindi": "",
      "hindiTransliteration": "भटं भले ॥४९४॥",
